msgstr "Comprobando elementos de la Biblioteca de medios… %1$s / %2$s"

#. translators: %s: number of upload files checked
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-media-cleaner.php:479
#, php-format
msgid "Scanning uploads folder… %s files checked"
msgstr "Escaneando la carpeta uploads… %s archivos comprobados"

#. translators: 1: attachments checked, 2: upload files checked
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-media-cleaner.php:485
#, php-format
msgid "Done. Media Library: %1$s · Uploads files: %2$s"
msgstr "Hecho. Biblioteca de medios: %1$s · Archivos de uploads: %2$s"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-media-cleaner.php:750
msgid ""
"Complete walk of wp-content/uploads. Skips thumbnail variants "
"(-WIDTHxHEIGHT), protected plugin folders (TSO backups/cache/config), and "
"guard files (index.php, .htaccess)."
msgstr ""
"Recorrido completo de wp-content/uploads. Omite variantes de miniaturas "
"(-ANCHOxALTO), carpetas protegidas de plugins (copias TSO/caché/config) y "
"archivos de protección (index.php, .htaccess)."

#. translators: %s: number of files checked
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-media-cleaner.php:756
#, php-format
msgid "Uploads files checked in the last full review: %s."
msgstr "Archivos de uploads comprobados en la última revisión completa: %s."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-media-cleaner.php:762
msgid ""
"No unreferenced files found. The full uploads walk completed with no orphans"
" outside the excluded folders."
msgstr ""
"No se encontraron archivos no referenciados. El recorrido completo de "
"uploads terminó sin huérfanos fuera de las carpetas excluidas."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-content-audit.php:218
msgid ""
"Each row is one post or page. If it contains several broken shortcodes, you "
"can remove one tag at a time or all broken tags in that post."
msgstr ""
"Cada fila es una entrada o página. Si contiene varios shortcodes rotos, "
"puedes eliminar una etiqueta concreta o todas las de esa entrada."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-content-audit.php:254
