msgid ""
"Inspect hidden WordPress registries loaded in the current request: post "
"types, statuses, taxonomies, roles, query vars, rewrite tags and shortcodes."
msgstr ""
"Inspecciona los registros ocultos de WordPress cargados en la petición "
