msgstr "Último cambio"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-runtime-stack.php:359
msgid "Must-use plugins (always on)"
msgstr "Plugins de uso obligatorio (siempre activos)"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-runtime-stack.php:361
msgid ""
"Files in mu-plugins load for everyone and cannot be deactivated from the "
"Plugins screen. Hosting panels and this plugin’s Sandbox loader may appear "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Los archivos de mu-plugins se cargan para todos y no se pueden desactivar "
"desde Plugins. Aquí pueden aparecer paneles del alojamiento y el cargador "
"del Sandbox de este plugin."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-runtime-stack.php:364
msgid "No must-use plugins found."
msgstr "No se ha encontrado ningún plugin de uso obligatorio."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-site-snapshot.php:108
msgid "Staging Mode settings"
msgstr "Ajustes del modo de prueba"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-site-snapshot.php:969
msgid "Staging Mode section must be an object."
msgstr "La sección del modo de prueba debe ser un objeto."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:132
msgid "STAGING"
msgstr "PRUEBA"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:136
msgid "This copy is marked as a test site. Open Staging Mode settings."
msgstr ""
"Esta copia está marcada como web de prueba. Abre los ajustes del modo de "
"prueba."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:185
msgid "Settings saved. Reload the page to apply them fully."
msgstr ""
"Ajustes guardados. Vuelve a cargar la página para aplicarlos por completo."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:199
msgid "Mail log cleared."
msgstr "Registro de correos vaciado."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:342
msgid ""
"Use this on a test copy of the site so it is obvious it is not production, "
"so search engines skip it, and so customer emails are not sent by mistake. "
"Everything stays off until you tick a box."
msgstr ""
"Úsalo en una copia de prueba del sitio para que quede claro que no es el "
"sitio en vivo, para que los buscadores no la listen y para que no se envíen "
"correos a los clientes por error. Todo permanece apagado hasta que marques "
"una casilla."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:346
msgid ""
"Turn these options off before you copy this database back to the live site. "
"They are saved in this WordPress install."
msgstr ""
"Apaga estas opciones antes de copiar esta base de datos al sitio en vivo. Se"
" guardan en esta instalación de WordPress."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:350
msgid "Test-site options"
msgstr "Opciones de la copia de prueba"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:353
msgid "Show a red STAGING label in the admin bar"
msgstr "Mostrar una etiqueta roja PRUEBA en la barra de admin"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:355
msgid ""
"Visible to administrators so nobody confuses this copy with the live site."
msgstr ""
"Visible para los administradores para que nadie confunda esta copia con el "
"sitio en vivo."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:360
msgid "Ask search engines not to list this copy"
msgstr "Pedir a los buscadores que no listen esta copia"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:362
msgid ""
"Adds no-index signals while this option is on. It does not permanently "
"change Settings → Reading."
msgstr ""
"Añade señales de no indexar mientras la opción está activa. No cambia de "
"forma permanente Ajustes → Lectura."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:367
msgid "Do not send real emails"
msgstr "No enviar correos reales"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:369
msgid ""
"WordPress will think the email was sent, but nothing leaves the server. A "
"short copy is kept in the log below. Use this so a test shop does not email "
"real customers."
msgstr ""
"WordPress pensará que el correo se envió, pero no sale del servidor. Se "
"guarda una copia corta en el registro de abajo. Sirve para que una tienda de"
" prueba no escriba a los clientes de verdad."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:374
msgid "Keep a copy of emails even when they are sent"
msgstr "Guardar una copia de los correos aunque se envíen"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:376
msgid ""
"Useful on the live site when you need to see whether WordPress tried to send"
" a message. Only administrators can read the log. Message bodies are "
"shortened."
msgstr ""
"Útil en el sitio en vivo cuando necesitas ver si WordPress intentó enviar un"
" mensaje. Solo los administradores pueden leer el registro. El cuerpo del "
"mensaje se acorta."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:388
msgid "Recent emails"
msgstr "Correos recientes"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:390
msgid ""
"Stored as JSON under the plugin uploads folder (not in the public media "
"library listing). The last 100 messages are kept. Full HTML bodies are not "
"stored."
msgstr ""
"Se guarda como JSON en la carpeta de uploads del plugin (no en la biblioteca"
" de medios pública). Se conservan los últimos 100 mensajes. No se guarda el "
"HTML completo."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:393
msgid "No emails recorded yet."
msgstr "Todavía no hay ningún correo registrado."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:398
msgid "When"
msgstr "Cuándo"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:399
msgid "To"
msgstr "Para"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:401
msgid "Sent?"
msgstr "¿Enviado?"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:417
msgid "Held here"
msgstr "Retenido aquí"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:419
msgid "Allowed to send"
msgstr "Se ha dejado enviar"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-staging.php:429
msgid "Clear mail log"
msgstr "Vaciar el registro de correos"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:90
msgid "Saved addresses"
msgstr "Direcciones guardadas"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:91
msgid "WordPress does not have two valid web addresses stored."
msgstr "WordPress no tiene dos direcciones web válidas guardadas."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:92
msgid "Open Settings → General and check WordPress Address and Site Address."
msgstr ""
"Abre Ajustes → Generales y revisa la dirección de WordPress y la dirección "
"del sitio."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:100
msgid "Public site vs admin address"
msgstr "Sitio público vs dirección de admin"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:102
msgid "Both addresses use the same domain. That is what you usually want."
msgstr ""
"Las dos direcciones usan el mismo dominio. Es lo que normalmente quieres."

#. translators: 1: home host, 2: site host
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:105
#, php-format
msgid "The public site is %1$s but the admin address is %2$s."
msgstr "El sitio público es %1$s pero la dirección de admin es %2$s."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:111
msgid ""
"After a move, these two often disagree. Search & Replace can fix stored "
"links once you know the correct domain."
msgstr ""
"Tras un cambio de servidor a menudo no coinciden. Buscar y reemplazar puede "
"arreglar los enlaces cuando sepas el dominio correcto."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:119
msgid "Padlock (HTTPS)"
msgstr "Candado (HTTPS)"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:121
msgid "Both saved addresses start with https."
msgstr "Las dos direcciones guardadas empiezan por https."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:122
msgid ""
"At least one saved address still starts with http. Browsers will warn "
"visitors or mix secure and insecure files."
msgstr ""
"Al menos una dirección guardada todavía empieza por http. El navegador "
"avisará a los visitantes o mezclará archivos seguros e inseguros."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:125
msgid ""
"Use a certificate on the server, then update both addresses to https (or run"
" Search & Replace on a backup first)."
msgstr ""
"Pon un certificado en el servidor y luego pasa las dos direcciones a https "
"(o ejecuta Buscar y reemplazar sobre una copia de seguridad)."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:137
msgid "This visit vs saved address"
msgstr "Esta visita vs la dirección guardada"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:139
msgid ""
"The way you opened this page matches the saved public address (http or "
"https)."
msgstr ""
"La forma en que has abierto esta página coincide con la dirección pública "
"guardada (http o https)."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:140
msgid ""
"You opened this page with a different padlock setting than the address "
"WordPress has saved. Logins and cookies often break in that case."
msgstr ""
"Has abierto esta página con un candado distinto del que WordPress tiene "
"guardado. En ese caso suelen fallar el inicio de sesión y las cookies."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:143
msgid ""
"Always open the admin using the same https/www form as Settings → General."
msgstr ""
"Abre siempre el admin con la misma forma https/www que en Ajustes → "
"Generales."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:149
msgid "www vs without www"
msgstr "www vs sin www"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:153
msgid "Both addresses use www."
msgstr "Las dos direcciones usan www."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:154
msgid "Both addresses skip www."
msgstr "Las dos direcciones van sin www."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:156
msgid ""
"One address uses www and the other does not. That usually causes extra "
"redirects or mixed cookies."
msgstr ""
"Una dirección usa www y la otra no. Eso suele provocar redirecciones de más "
"o cookies mezcladas."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:159
msgid ""
"Pick one form (with or without www) and keep it everywhere, including Search"
" & Replace if needed."
msgstr ""
"Elige una forma (con www o sin) y mantenla en todas partes, también en "
"Buscar y reemplazar si hace falta."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:165
msgid "Folder in the address"
msgstr "Carpeta en la dirección"

#. translators: 1: home path, 2: site path
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:169
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Public path: %1$s. WordPress path: %2$s. This is normal when WordPress lives"
" in a subfolder."
msgstr ""
"Ruta pública: %1$s. Ruta de WordPress: %2$s. Es normal si WordPress vive en "
"una subcarpeta."

#. translators: %s: URL path
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:175
#, php-format
msgid "Both addresses use the path %s."
msgstr "Las dos direcciones usan la ruta %s."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:183
msgid "Force HTTPS for wp-admin"
msgstr "Forzar HTTPS en wp-admin"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:185
msgid "FORCE_SSL_ADMIN is on. The dashboard should only load over https."
msgstr ""
"FORCE_SSL_ADMIN está activo. El escritorio solo debería cargarse con https."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:186
msgid ""
"FORCE_SSL_ADMIN is not on. That is fine if the whole site already uses "
"https."
msgstr ""
"FORCE_SSL_ADMIN no está activo. Está bien si todo el sitio ya usa https."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:195
msgid "Locked in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Bloqueado en wp-config.php"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:196
msgid ""
"WP_HOME and/or WP_SITEURL are defined in wp-config.php, so Settings → "
"General cannot change those addresses. This plugin never edits that file."
msgstr ""
"WP_HOME y/o WP_SITEURL están definidos en wp-config.php, así que Ajustes → "
"Generales no puede cambiar esas direcciones. Este plugin nunca edita ese "
"archivo."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:197
msgid ""
"If the constants are wrong after a move, edit wp-config.php on the server "
"(or ask hosting)."
msgstr ""
"Si las constantes son incorrectas tras un cambio, edita wp-config.php en el "
"servidor (o pide ayuda al alojamiento)."

#. translators: %d: HTTP status
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:254
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This site answered with status %d. The public address looks reachable from "
"the server."
msgstr ""
"Este sitio ha respondido con el estado %d. La dirección pública parece "
"accesible desde el servidor."

#. translators: %s: final URL host
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:260
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The request ended on a different domain (%s). Check redirects, CDN, or a "
"leftover old address."
msgstr ""
"La petición ha terminado en otro dominio (%s). Revisa redirecciones, CDN o "
"una dirección antigua que haya quedado."

#. translators: %d: HTTP status
#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:266
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The public address answered with status %d. That is not a normal success "
"page."
msgstr ""
"La dirección pública ha respondido con el estado %d. No es una página de "
"éxito normal."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:299
msgid ""
"This screen explains whether the two addresses WordPress has saved still "
"match how you open the site (https, www, folder). It does not change the "
"database. Use Search & Replace only after you know the correct address."
msgstr ""
"Esta pantalla explica si las dos direcciones que WordPress tiene guardadas "
"siguen coincidiendo con cómo abres el sitio (https, www, carpeta). No cambia"
" la base de datos. Usa Buscar y reemplazar solo cuando sepas la dirección "
"correcta."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:303
msgid "Addresses WordPress has saved"
msgstr "Direcciones que WordPress tiene guardadas"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:306
msgid "Public site (Home)"
msgstr "Sitio público (Home)"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:310
msgid "WordPress address (Site URL)"
msgstr "Dirección de WordPress (Site URL)"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:317
msgid "What we found"
msgstr "Qué hemos encontrado"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:322
msgid "Result"
msgstr "Resultado"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:323
msgid "What it means"
msgstr "Qué significa"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:344
msgid "Can the server reach its own public page?"
msgstr "¿Puede el servidor alcanzar su propia página pública?"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:346
msgid ""
"Optional. Only runs when you click the button. It asks this site’s own home "
"address from the server (the same idea as Site Health). No other website is "
"contacted."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. Solo se ejecuta cuando pulsas el botón. El servidor pregunta a la "
"propia dirección de inicio de este sitio (la misma idea que Salud del "
"sitio). No se contacta ningún otro sitio."

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:350
msgid "Check this site"
msgstr "Comprobar este sitio"

#: includes/modules/class-tsosk-mod-url-doctor.php:358
msgid "Needs attention"
msgstr "Hay que revisarlo"
